<sync start=430><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>易考范文二十一</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　What is happiness?</font>
<sync start=3710><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>易考范文二十一</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　What is happiness?</font>
<sync start=6980><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>This is an age-old question that has been puzzling people from all walks of life.</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　Although different people has different opinions about it,</font>
<sync start=12890><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>This is an age-old question that has been puzzling people from all walks of life.</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　Although different people has different opinions about it,</font>
<sync start=16400><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>we all agree that it is such a precious thing</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　that cannot be bought by money or anything else.</font>
<sync start=19780><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>we all agree that it is such a precious thing</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　that cannot be bought by money or anything else.</font>
<sync start=23180><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>And despite many scientific studies carried out on happiness,</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　no really effective way to gain happiness has yet been found and introduced.</font>
<sync start=27650><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>And despite many scientific studies carried out on happiness,</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　no really effective way to gain happiness has yet been found and introduced.</font>
<sync start=33670><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>Everyone wants to live a happy life and to find happiness at every turn.</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　But what should we do then?</font>
<sync start=39140><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>Everyone wants to live a happy life and to find happiness at every turn.</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　But what should we do then?</font>
<sync start=41550><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>My answer is we should do something rather than wait passively.</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　Sages told us hundreds of years ago that when we give,</font>
<sync start=47020><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>My answer is we should do something rather than wait passively.</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　Sages told us hundreds of years ago that when we give,</font>
<sync start=51400><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>we are far happier than when we receive.</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　That means we are responsible for other people's happiness</font>
<sync start=54570><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>we are far happier than when we receive.</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　That means we are responsible for other people's happiness</font>
<sync start=58620><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>and we should take the initiative in securing happiness.</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　We always have to be ready to give a hand to people in need.</font>
<sync start=62330><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>and we should take the initiative in securing happiness.</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　We always have to be ready to give a hand to people in need.</font>
<sync start=66490><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>We should form a supportive network with people around us.</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　Only in this way are we able to find true life-time happiness.</font>
<sync start=70760><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>We should form a supportive network with people around us.</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　Only in this way are we able to find true life-time happiness.</font>
<sync start=75570><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>Happiness is all around us in our daily life.</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　All we have to do is make an effort to be happy and to make others happy.</font>
<sync start=79070><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>Happiness is all around us in our daily life.</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　All we have to do is make an effort to be happy and to make others happy.</font>
<sync start=84540><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>So don't hesitate to focus on other people's happiness,</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　in other words, value the pursuit of happiness for ourselves and for others.</font>
<sync start=88700><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>So don't hesitate to focus on other people's happiness,</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　in other words, value the pursuit of happiness for ourselves and for others.</font>
<sync start=93950><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>Remember: “Life is what you make it. So make it happy.”</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　</font>
<sync start=95950><p class=ZHCC><font color=#C0C0C0>Remember: “Life is what you make it. So make it happy.”</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　</font>
